  m_text: "\tThis type of waste contains or is contaminated with harmful substances
    that can be dangerous to humans, animals, plants, and the environment. Examples
    include batteries, fluorescent bulbs, chemicals, and paint. Proper disposal methods
    are crucial to prevent these substances from contaminating the environment and
    posing health risks."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1db166619d5ba4bb2bf9a4cc03164a61, type: 2}
