  m_text: "\r\nWelcome to \"Sandee's Adventure\"!\r\n\r\n\tIn this game, you'll play
    as Sandee, the Youth Red Cross adventurer who travels the world helping those
    in need. Currently, you find yourself in Tara Town, facing a waste problem. \n\tYour
    mission is to clean up the town by collecting the waste scattered around. After
    collecting the waste, you'll need to sort it into the appropriate trash bins
    located throughout the town.\r\n\r\n\n\nPlease note: This is only the demo version
    of the game."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1db166619d5ba4bb2bf9a4cc03164a61, type: 2}
